# [wp-8] The 10-client fight measurement (docs/design/fx-budget.md, the game's docs/verify.md "Fight measurement"):
# arena250.session with a 5v5 deathmatch. One charge comes back every 60 ticks, so 10 bots with --casts 60 keep
# 10 casts/s. The round starts when the 10 bots are on their teams and lasts longer than the 600 s run; the score
# limit is out of reach, so no team wins before the run ends.
#   vortex_server --session fight10.session --listen 27065 --bind 127.0.0.1 --token T --seconds 660
# This token is in the repository, so it is public: a run gives its own token with --token.
